"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trawor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trawor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trawor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trawor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trawor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trawor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trawor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trawor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T07:01:38Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T07:01:38Z","body":"我临时是这么干的, \n\n``` \n  TRAE=\"/Applications/Trae.app\"\n    if [ -d \"$TRAE\" ]; then\n        alias trae=\"$TRAE/Contents/MacOS/Electron\"\n        alias code=\"$TRAE/Contents/MacOS/Electron\"\n    fi\n``` ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/2689889026/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/2709618164","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/246#issuecomment-2709618164","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/246","id":2709618164,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc6hgX30","user":{"login":"weihuakuang","id":141756962,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHMKIg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141756962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/weihuakuang","html_url":"https://github.com/weihuakuang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weihuakuang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weihuakuang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weihuakuang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weihuakuang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weihuakuang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weihuakuang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weihuakuang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weihuakuang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weihuakuang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-10T07:05:41Z","updated_at":"2025-03-10T07:05:41Z","body":"我在安装 Trae 的目录下 /Trae/bin 找到了和 cursor 命令行工具相似的两个文件： trae, trae.cmd。\n可以试试手动添加这两个文件，并将 bin 路径添加到环境变量中。\n\n文件具体内容如下：\n\ntrae\n```\n#!/usr/bin/env sh\n#\n# Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.\n# Licensed under the MIT License. See License.txt in the project root for license information.\nif [ \"$VSCODE_WSL_DEBUG_INFO\" = true ]; then\n\tset -x\nfi\n\nCOMMIT=\",\"\nAPP_NAME=\"trae\"\nQUALITY=\"stable\"\nNAME=\"Trae\"\nSERVERDATAFOLDER=\".trae-server\"\nVSCODE_PATH=\"$(dirname \"$(dirname \"$(realpath \"$0\")\")\")\"\nELECTRON=\"$VSCODE_PATH/$NAME.exe\"\n\nIN_WSL=false\nif [ -n \"$WSL_DISTRO_NAME\" ]; then\n\t# $WSL_DISTRO_NAME is available since WSL builds 18362, also for WSL2\n\tIN_WSL=true\nelse\n\tWSL_BUILD=$(uname -r | sed -E 's/^[0-9.]+-([0-9]+)-Microsoft.*|.*/\\1/')\n\tif [ -n \"$WSL_BUILD\" ]; then\n\t\tif [ \"$WSL_BUILD\" -ge 17063 ]; then\n\t\t\t# WSLPATH is available since WSL build 17046\n\t\t\t# WSLENV is available since WSL build 17063\n\t\t\tIN_WSL=true\n\t\telse\n\t\t\t# If running under older WSL, don't pass cli.js to Electron as\n\t\t\t# environment vars cannot be transferred from WSL to Windows\n\t\t\t# See: https://github.com/microsoft/BashOnWindows/issues/1363\n\t\t\t#      https://github.com/microsoft/BashOnWindows/issues/1494\n\t\t\t\"$ELECTRON\" \"$@\"\n\t\t\texit $?\n\t\tfi\n\tfi\nfi\nif [ $IN_WSL = true ]; then\n\n\texport WSLENV=\"ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE/w:$WSLENV\"\n\tCLI=$(wslpath -m \"$VSCODE_PATH/resources/app/out/cli.js\")\n\n\t# use the Remote WSL extension if installed\n\tWSL_EXT_ID=\"ms-vscode-remote.remote-wsl\"\n\n\tELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE=1 \"$ELECTRON\" \"$CLI\" --locate-extension $WSL_EXT_ID >/tmp/remote-wsl-loc.txt 2>/dev/null </dev/null\n\tWSL_EXT_WLOC=$(cat /tmp/remote-wsl-loc.txt)\n\n\tif [ -n \"$WSL_EXT_WLOC\" ]; then\n\t\t# replace \\r\\n with \\n in WSL_EXT_WLOC\n\t\tWSL_CODE=$(wslpath -u \"${WSL_EXT_WLOC%%[[:cntrl:]]}\")/scripts/wslCode.sh\n\t\t\"$WSL_CODE\" \"$COMMIT\" \"$QUALITY\" \"$ELECTRON\" \"$APP_NAME\" \"$SERVERDATAFOLDER\" \"$@\"\n\t\texit $?\n\tfi\n\nelif [ -x \"$(command -v cygpath)\" ]; then\n\tCLI=$(cygpath -m \"$VSCODE_PATH/resources/app/out/cli.js\")\nelse\n\tCLI=\"$VSCODE_PATH/resources/app/out/cli.js\"\nfi\nELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE=1 \"$ELECTRON\" \"$CLI\" \"$@\"\nexit $?\n\n```\n\ntrae.txt\n```\n@echo off\nsetlocal\nset VSCODE_DEV=\nset ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE=1\n\"%~dp0..\\Trae.exe\" \"%~dp0..\\resources\\app\\out\\cli.js\" %*\nIF %ERRORLEVEL% NEQ 0 EXIT /b %ERRORLEVEL%\nendlocal\n```\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/2709618164/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3609643299","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/246#issuecomment-3609643299","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/246","id":3609643299,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7XJskj","user":{"login":"chchmlml","id":899907,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5OTkwNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/899907?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chchmlml","html_url":"https://github.com/chchmlml","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chchmlml/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chchmlml/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chch